  "execution": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Route Room Execution Execution MF-2409-117 · day 0 to 14 · four agents Nothing is executing yetListing, outreach, negotiation and the food-bank booking start the moment the plan is approved. ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Back to Route Room | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings⟩",
  "inbox": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Inbox Inbox All caught up No notificationsPushes from the agents land here too, so nothing is lost if a phone was off. ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings⟩",
  "paperwork": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Paperwork Paperwork MF-2409-117 · prepared by the Paperwork agent at the award The pack is drafted at the awardRakesh's tax invoice, the e-way bill check, Munchly's price-support credit note, the ITC memo, the FSSAI checklist and the destruction certificate, each generated or marked not required with the reason. Paperwork agentDrafts the whole pack once the lot is awarded and on the buyer's truck. ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings⟩",
  "profile": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Profile Profile Supply-chain operator Priya Deshmukh Supply-chain operator · Munchly FoodsGoogle Workspace · priya.deshmukh@munchly.in Workspace Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.comMunchly staff Your work Setup and guardrailsDMS mapping, floors, territory guard, permissionsFinance & ESGLedger, BRSR export Appearance ThemeLightDarkAuto Notifications LanguageEnglishहिन्दीPush notificationsWeekly digest by email Offers to the trade go out in the language each person picks. Account Switch personTry the journey as someone else in the story Reset demo dataPuts the batch back to the start Sign outBack to munchly.smartclearance.com ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Theme | Notification language | Push notifications | Weekly digest⟩",
  "report": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Finance & ESG QuarterThis batch Finance & ESG Q3 FY27 · Oct to Dec 2026 · one ledger, two readings Recovered₹6.3 lakh₹60123456789.30123456789lakh GST credit protected₹79,000₹7012345678990123456789,001234567890012345678900123456789 Kept out of landfill5.750123456789.70123456789 t CO₂e avoided14.251012345678940123456789.2012345678950123456789 tindicative · 2.5 kg a kg Meals served3,70030123456789,701234567890012345678900123456789 A synthetic quarter: the totals are the walkthrough's; the weekly split, the channel mix and the BRSR split below are illustrative. Week 1 is this batch. Recovered against the would-be write-off Illustrative weekly split of the quarter RecoveredWould-be write-off 0₹35k₹70kW1W3W5W7W9W11W13 Channel mix Share of units by where they went · illustrative Kirana scheme: 42%ExpireSoon: 38%Staff sale: 5%Food bank: 12%Write-off: 3% Kirana scheme 42%ExpireSoon 38%Staff sale 5%Food bank 12%Write-off 3% How the tax maths works Destroying stock costs more than the stock. You lose it at cost, reverse the GST input credit under Section 17(5)(h), pay to dispose of it, and owe EPR on the product and pack. Selling it under a tax invoice keeps the credit. That is why every routed batch protects its ITC, even at half the MRP. Donations reverse it. Section 17(5)(h) blocks credit on gifts, and since 1 October 2023 section 17(5)(fa) blocks it on CSR donations too, so a food-bank route costs the credit on every pack. Disposal ₹1.50 a unit, indicativeEPR ₹6 a kg, indicativeCO₂e 2.5 kg per kg, indicative 5.7 tonnes kept out of landfill this quarter, with invoices behind every kilo. That goes straight into the annual report. Vikram · sustainability BRSR Core Principle 6, waste management · the quarter's 5.7 t, split illustrative Export BRSR table CategoryDiverted, kgResoldDonatedDisposedEvidenceFood waste: packaged food past quick-commerce gates4,8404,26058060Tax invoices, ExpireSoon listing IDs, in-app order logs, food-bank receiptsPlastic packaging (EPR)8607709010Packaging weights per SKU, EPR factor, the same invoices ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Period | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Weekly recovered against would-be write-off | Channel mix | BRSR waste table⟩",
  "route": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Command Center Route Room Route Room MF-2409-117 · Munchly Masala Chips 150 g · Rakesh Traders, Nagpur 47days leftbest before 18 Nov 2026 Blinkit47/90Zepto47/110Instamart47/1101,360 of 1,840 units at risk · sells 12 a day ConnectonceDetect09:00Verify09:20Value09:21Decide09:22Approve09:40Executeday 0⁠–⁠14Settleday 3⁠–⁠7Reportafter 29 Oct Label, read from the shelf Vision · 09:20 MUNCHLYMasala Chips 150 gBATCH MF-2409-117MFG 18 MAY 2026BEST BEFORE 18 NOV 2026MRP ₹30.00 incl. of all taxes24 × 150 g No label photo yetVision asks the godown before quoting any price Vision AgentPrices nothing until a person photographs one carton label on the shelf. Five channels, priced Valuer · 09:21 · per unit, after costs Valuer AgentPrices five channels once the label is verified. Recommended split Router · 09:22 Router AgentProposes a split once the channels are priced. Agent timeline Gaps drawn to the clock ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Back to Command Center | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 47 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 184-day life (110 days), has 47 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 184-day life (110 days), has 47 | Stages | Carton label, not yet photographed⟩",
  "setup": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Setup Setup Connect the stock data once and set the rules the agents must obey dms_export_2026-10-01.csvBizom-style DMS export · 312 batches · 4 distributorsMapped · confirm below Smart-Clearance fieldColumn in your fileStatusdistributordistributor_namemappedskuitem_codemappedbatchbatch_nomappedmfgmfg_datemappedbest beforebb_datemappedunitsclosing_qtymappedgodownlocationmappedpincodepinmapped Data Agent mapped 8 of 8 columns and back-filled 90 days of sell-through by pincode and by shop. Floor price by category Snacks₹10.50 on a ₹30 pack35%Biscuits₹14.00 on a ₹40 pack35%Staples₹22.00 on a ₹55 pack40%Beverages₹6.00 on a ₹20 pack30%Personal care₹48.00 on a ₹120 pack40% No channel may sell below its category's floor. Territory guard Nagpur with Wardha and KampteeRakesh Traders · pincodes 440, 441, 442…PunePatil Distributors · pincodes 411, 412…IndoreGupta & Sons · pincodes 452, 453…HyderabadLakshmi Agencies · pincodes 500, 501… Hide listings inside the territories ExpireSoon listings are hidden from buyers inside these territories, matched by pincode, so clearance stock never undercuts a Munchly distributor. Approval policy Routes per channel that need a tap10 Personal care never goes to food banks Premium gift packs never go to a staff sale After that the agents run inside the guardrails and report. Channel allow-list CategoryExpireSoonKiranasStaff saleFood banksnacksAllowedAllowedAllowedAllowedbiscuitsAllowedAllowedAllowedAllowedstaplesAllowedAllowedAllowedAllowedbeveragesAllowedAllowedAllowedAllowedpersonal careAllowedAllowedAllowedNever Discount D2C applies only to Munchly's own warehouse stock. A distributor's stock is his, so it never goes to Munchly's own site. Distributors' one-time permission Rakesh TradersNagpurrequestedPatil DistributorsPunegranted · 1 OctGupta & SonsIndoregranted · 1 OctLakshmi AgenciesHyderabadgranted · 1 Oct Each distributor lets the agent list his Munchly stock, offer schemes to his kiranas, draft his invoices and book dispatch slots, inside Munchly's floors. He can pause it at any time. Give the permission as Rakesh bhai Scheme returns and planning Kiranas may return scheme packs until29 Oct for this batch20 days before Scheme uplift on normal sales3.5× Van rate, a unit₹0.50 The uplift and the van rate are planning assumptions. The return window lets returned packs reach the godown in time for a staff sale or a food bank. Feeding Indiapartner 15+ days left · at least 50 units · Volunteer pickup within 48 h, hunger spots in 100+ citiesIn-app receiptIndia FoodBanking Networkpartner 21+ days left · at least 100 units · Drop at a member warehouse or a scheduled pickupDonation acknowledgement (CSR / 80G, indicative) The true cost of a write-offshown before any batch is routed Stock at cost₹16.00+ GST credit reversed₹0.90+ Disposal₹1.50+ EPR, indicative₹0.96 = Destroying, a unitminus ₹19.36−₹19.36 For Masala Chips 150 g: cost ₹16; ₹0.90 of input GST a packet from the cost sheet (chips are at 5% GST since GST 2.0); disposal ₹1.50 a unit; EPR ₹6 a kilo of product and pack. Factors marked indicative are editable here. Confirm and start watching ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Field mapping | Floor for Snacks | Fewer Floor for Snacks | More Floor for Snacks | Floor for Biscuits | Fewer Floor for Biscuits | More Floor for Biscuits | Floor for Staples | Fewer Floor for Staples | More Floor for Staples | Floor for Beverages | Fewer Floor for Beverages | More Floor for Beverages | Floor for Personal care | Fewer Floor for Personal care | More Floor for Personal care | Territory guard | routes | Fewer routes | More routes | Personal care never to food banks | Gift packs never to staff sale | Channel rules by category | days before best-before | Fewer days before best-before | More days before best-before | Scheme uplift | Fewer Scheme uplift | More Scheme uplift | Van rate | Fewer Van rate | More Van rate⟩",
}
`;

