  "paperwork": "Paperwork Paperwork MF-2409-117 · prepared by the Paperwork agent at the award The pack is drafted at the awardRakesh's tax invoice, the e-way bill check, Munchly's price-support credit note, the ITC memo, the FSSAI checklist and the destruction certificate, each generated or marked not required with the reason. Paperwork agentDrafts the whole pack once the lot is awarded and on the buyer's truck. PaperworkReportsBatches ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Main⟩",
