or Gupta & Sons | Actions for Gupta & Sons | Actions for India FoodBanking Network | Actions for India FoodBanking Network | Actions for Jai Durga Stores | Actions for Jai Durga Stores | Actions for Krishna Kirana Bhandar | Actions for Krishna Kirana Bhandar | Actions for Lakshmi Agencies | Actions for Lakshmi Agencies | Actions for Meera | Actions for Meera | Actions for Patil Distributors | Actions for Patil Distributors | Actions for Priya Deshmukh | Actions for Priya Deshmukh | Actions for Rakesh bhai | Actions for Rakesh bhai | Actions for Shree Sai Kirana | Actions for Shree Sai Kirana | Actions for Vikram Sethi | Actions for Vikram Sethi⟩",
  "workspace": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Workspace Users Guardrails Integrations Audit log Arjun NairWorkspace admin · Munchly Foods Workspace Workspace munchly.smartclearance.com · set up by Smart-Clearance for Munchly's supply chain Munchly Foods munchly.smartclearance.com live since 1 Oct 2026PilotIndia, Mumbai region4 staff · 7 partners Powered bySmart‑Clearance How people sign in Each workspace sets its own; these are Munchly's Google WorkspaceMunchly staff · munchly.in accounts onlyonMobile number and a one-time codeDistributors and kirana owners · Numbers Munchly or their distributor invitedonGoogle, by invitationPartners such as food banks · Addresses Munchly invitedon Marketplace buyersMarketplace buyers sign in to ExpireSoon, another company's site. They are never members of this workspace.outside Everyone signs in at the same address with an email or a phone number; the workspace picks the method. Branding The client's colours stay inside its mark Workspace markShown under the Smart-Clearance mark, on the sign-in page and in the workspace sheet NameMunchly Foods Addressmunchly.smartclearance.com Notifications arrive asSmart-Clearance Supply chain, as set up for Munchly Another manufacturer's workspace is set up for its own chain Munchly FoodsPune · sells only to distributors 4 distributorsown the stock they buy 195 kiranason the salesmen's beatsQuick-commerce warehousesBlinkit, Zepto, Instamart; turn short-dated stock away Route to market4 distributors. Munchly sells only to its distributors. Each one supplies the kiranas on his salesman's beat and the Blinkit, Zepto and Instamart warehouses in his city.Who owns short-dated stockThe distributor. He bought it at ₹22.00 a pack, so the agent lists, offers and invoices in his name, with his one-time permission.Expiry policyFull credit at expiry. Expired stock comes back to Munchly for full credit and is destroyed, so Munchly acts before expiry and pays price support instead of a claim.Quick-commerce gatesBlinkit 90+ days · Zepto, Instamart 60% of life. A batch that misses a gate stays in the distributor's godown.Exits for distributor stockFour, and the bin as the baseline. ExpireSoon, the kirana scheme, a staff sale at the godown and food banks. Discount D2C and the Pune plant staff sale apply only to Munchly's own warehouse stock.Territory guard4 territories. ExpireSoon listings are hidden from buyers inside Munchly's distributor territories, matched by pincode.Scheme returnsUntil 20 days before best-before. Returned packs reach the godown in time for a staff sale or a food bank. Distributors Rakesh TradersNagpur with Wardha and Kamptee · pincodes 440, 441, 442… · staff sale up to 50granted · Thu 16:52Patil DistributorsPune · pincodes 411, 412… · staff sale up to 50granted · 1 OctGupta & SonsIndore · pincodes 452, 453… · staff sale up to 50granted · 1 OctLakshmi AgenciesHyderabad · pincodes 500, 501… · staff sale up to 150granted · 1 Oct Territories are matched by pincode for the territory guard; a godown may set its own staff-sale cap. Smart-Clearance sets up each manufacturer's workspace for its own supply chain: who owns short-dated stock, which exits exist, who approves and how people sign in. Changes to this profile go through Smart-Clearance onboarding; the guardrails, users and integrations are Munchly's to run. ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Arjun Nair · Workspace admin · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Munchly Foods sells to 4 distributors, who supply 195 kiranas and the Blinkit, Zepto and Instamart warehouses in their cities.⟩",
}
`;

