  "command": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Command Center Command Center Watcher runs daily at 09:00 across 312 batches Nothing at risk yetThe Watcher checks every batch against the quick-commerce gates and sell-through at 09:00. You get a push the moment one cannot make it.Watchlist Sorted by days to best-before; at-risk batches first Mango Drink 200 mlIn motion Lakshmi Agencies · Hyderabad· MF-2410-118 22 days left BlinkitZeptoInstamart Peanut Chikki 100 gGated · selling through Gupta & Sons · Indore· MF-2408-311 61 days left BlinkitZeptoInstamart Masala Chips 150 gGated · selling through Gupta & Sons · Indore· MF-2408-209 74 days left BlinkitZeptoInstamart Masala Oats 200 gGated · selling through Patil Distributors · Pune· MF-2409-415 75 days left BlinkitZeptoInstamart Choco Cream Biscuits 200 gGated · selling through Patil Distributors · Pune· MF-2409-204 96 days left BlinkitZeptoInstamart Instant Poha 250 gSafe Lakshmi Agencies · Hyderabad· MF-2410-402 200 days left BlinkitZeptoInstamart Aloe Face Wash 100 mlSafe Rakesh Traders · Nagpur· GL-2410-044 460 days left BlinkitZeptoInstamart Coconut Hair Oil 200 mlSafe Gupta & Sons · Indore· GL-2410-012 500 days left BlinkitZeptoInstamart Agent activity Every hand-off, as it happens DataagentThu 16:30 Mapped 8 DMS columns, loaded 312 batches from 4 distributors and back-filled 90 days of sell-through by pincode and by shop into BigQuery. bigquery.load→312 batchessellthrough.backfill→90 days · by pincode, by shop Rakesh bhaipersonThu 16:52 Gave Smart-Clearance a one-time permission to list his Munchly stock, offer schemes to his kiranas, draft his invoices and book dispatch slots, inside Munchly's floors. ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifica