{
  "batches": "Batches Batches Every lot the Watcher sees, from the DMS export Masala Chips 150 gAwaiting approval Rakesh Traders · Nagpur 47 days left Mango Drink 200 mlIn motion Lakshmi Agencies · Hyderabad 22 days left Masala Chips 150 gGated · selling through Gupta & Sons · Indore 74 days left Peanut Chikki 100 gGated · selling through Gupta & Sons · Indore 61 days left Masala Oats 200 gGated · selling through Patil Distributors · Pune 75 days left Choco Cream Biscuits 200 gGated · selling through Patil Distributors · Pune 96 days left Instant Poha 250 gSafe Lakshmi Agencies · Hyderabad 200 days left Aloe Face Wash 100 mlSafe Rakesh Traders · Nagpur 460 days left Coconut Hair Oil 200 mlSafe Gupta & Sons · Indore 500 days left PaperworkReportsBatches ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | 47 of 180 days of shelf life left | 22 of 180 days of shelf life left | 74 of 180 days of shelf life left | 61 of 180 days of shelf life left | 75 of 270 days of shelf life left | 96 of 270 days of shelf life left | 200 of 270 days of shelf life left | 460 of 730 days of shelf life left | 500 of 730 days of shelf life left | Main⟩",
  "inbox": "Inbox Inbox All caught up No notificationsPushes from the agents land here too, so nothing is lost if a phone was off. PaperworkReportsBatches ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Main⟩",
  "paperwork": "Paperwork Paperwork MF-2409-117 · prepared by the Paperwork agent at the award The pack is drafted at the awardRakesh's tax invoice, the e-way bill check, Munchly's price-support credit note, the ITC memo, the FSSAI checklist and the destruction certificate, each generated or marked not required with the reason. Paperwork agentDrafts the whole pack once the lot is awarded and on the buyer's truck. PaperworkReportsBatches ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Main⟩",
  "profile": "Profile Profile Finance & GST Anita Rao Finance & GST · Munchly FoodsGoogle Workspace · anita.rao@munchly.in Workspace Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.comMunchly staff Appearance ThemeLightDarkAuto Notifications LanguageEnglishहिन्दीPush notificationsWeekly digest by email Offers to the trade go out in the language each person picks. Account Switch personTry the journey as someone else in the story Reset demo dataPuts the batch back to the start Sign outBack to munchly.smartclearance.com PaperworkReportsBatches ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Theme | Notification language | Push notifications | Weekly digest | Main⟩",
  "report": "Finance & ESG Finance & ESG Q3 FY27 · Oct to Dec 2026 · one ledger, two readings QuarterThis batch Recovered₹6.3 lakh₹60123456789.30123456789lakh GST credit protected₹79,000₹7012345678990123456789,001234567890012345678900123456789 Kept out of landfill5.750123456789.70123456789 t CO₂e avoided14.251012345678940123456789.2012345678950123456789 tindicative · 2.5 kg a kg Meals served3,70030123456789,701234567890012345678900123456789 A synthetic quarter: the totals are the walkthrough's; the weekly split, the channel mix and the BRSR split below are illustrative. Week 1 is this batch. Recovered against the would-be write-off Illustrative weekly split of the quarter RecoveredWould-be write-off 0₹35k₹70kW1W3W5W7W9W11W13 Channel mix Share of units by where they went · illustrative Kirana scheme: 42%ExpireSoon: 38%Staff sale: 5%Food bank: 12%Write-off: 3% Kirana scheme 42%ExpireSoon 38%Staff sale 5%Food bank 12%Write-off 3%How the tax maths works Destroying stock costs more than the stock. You lose it at cost, reverse the GST input credit under Section 17(5)(h), pay to dispose of it, and owe EPR on the product and pack. Selling it under a tax invoice keeps the credit. That is why every routed batch protects its ITC, even at half the MRP. Donations reverse it. Section 17(5)(h) blocks credit on gifts, and since 1 October 2023 section 17(5)(fa) blocks it on CSR donations too, so a food-bank route costs the credit on every pack. Disposal ₹1.50 a unit, indicativeEPR ₹6 a kg, indicativeCO₂e 2.5 kg per kg, indicative 5.7 tonnes kept out of landfill this quarter, with invoices behind every kilo. That goes straight into the annual report. Vikram · sustainability BRSR Core Principle 6, waste management · the quarter's 5.7 t, split illustrative Export BRSR table CategoryDiverted, kgResoldDonatedDisposedEvidenceFood waste: packaged food past quick-commerce gates4,8404,26058060Tax invoices, ExpireSoon listing IDs, in-app order logs, food-bank receiptsPlastic packaging (EPR)8607709010Packaging weights per SKU, EPR factor, the same invoices PaperworkReportsBatches ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Period | Weekly recovered against would-be write-off | Channel mix | BRSR waste table | Main⟩",
}
`;

