ptember 2025. The MRP of ₹30.00 stays printed on every pack: a discounted sale is fine, a second MRP is not (Legal Metrology). ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Anita Rao · Finance & GST · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings⟩",
