  "execution": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Route Room Execution Execution MF-2409-117 · day 0 to 14 · four agents Lister · ExpireSoonawarded POST /v1/listings { "seller": "Rakesh Traders, Nagpur", "on_behalf": "one-time permission · inside Munchly floors", "sku": "MF-MC-150", "batch": "MF-2409-117", "units": 772, "price": 15.00, "reserve": 13.50, "mrp": 30.00, "best_before": "2026-11-18", "hide_from_pincodes": ["440", "441", "442", "411", "412", "452", "453", "500", "501"], "label_photo": "gs://smart-clearance/labels/MF-2409-117.jpg" }HTTP/1.1 201 Created { "id": "ES-24117", "status": "awarded", "url": "https://expiresoon.example/l/ES-24117" } The marketplace is mocked; the request and response are what a partner API returns. Buyers in Munchly's territories never see the lot. Open on ExpireSoon Outreach · 38 kiranaspush · Hindi नमस्ते Shree Ganesh Kirana! Munchly Masala Chips 150g पर आज खास ऑफर: 10 पैकेट लो, 2 मुफ़्त. Best before 18 Nov 2026. सिर्फ़ 48 घंटे. ऑर्डर के लिए टैप करें — Rakesh Traders 313012345678910123456789 / 38kiranas ordered 588501234567898012345678980123456789 / 588units ItwariMahalSitabuldiSadarDharampethKampteeWardha RoadWardhaKalamna godown Schematic map · not to scale Sainath Kirana Wardha12 11:41Anand General Store Dharampeth24 11:38Vithal Stores Mahal12 11:34 Negotiatorawarded · ₹14.20 Can you do ₹13 for all 772? Agrawal Wholesale, Raipur · 11:02 ₹14.20 for 772, Nagpur stock, dispatch within 24 h of balance. Rakesh Traders · Negotiator agent · 11:03 Ok, ₹14.20. Token paid. Agrawal Wholesale, Raipur · 11:09 ExpireSoon, planned772 × ₹15.00₹11,580ExpireSoon, actual772 × ₹14.20₹10,962Net, planned₹21,770Net, actual−₹618 on the counter₹21,152 Token ₹1,644 received · balance ₹9,318 plus IGST in 48 h Donation · Mango Drinkpickup confirmed MF-2410-118 · 22 days leftLakshmi Agencies, Hyderabad: 1,372 packs to her kiranas, 150 to her staff sale, 58 left for a food bank. Too few days for ExpireSoon. Feeding India15+ days, 50+ units · volunteer pickup in 48 hmatchesIndia FoodBanking Networkneeds 21+ days and 100+ units58 units The GST credit on donated packs is reversed: section 17(5)(h) blocks it on gifts, and since 1 October 2023 section 17(5)(fa) blocks it on CSR donations too. Shelf check · day 7Friday 9 Oct Rakesh's salesman counted the scheme packs at 31 shops on his beat. 30 are selling in time; one is slow. Jai Durga Stores, Kamptee18 of 24 left It took 24 a week ago, so it is selling about one a day. Pick up on Thursday's round12 packs Leave the ones it can sell in time6 packs Returns go to the Nagpur staff sale or to Feeding India, and are accepted until 29 Oct. Agent timeline Notifieragent09:23 Sent Priya the plan to review, and Rakesh bhai the same plan with a pause button. Priyaperson09:40 Approved the plan from her phone. Listeragent09:41 Posted 772 units on ExpireSoon in Rakesh Traders' name at ₹15, with the label photo and dates. Reserve ₹13.50; hidden from buyers inside Munchly's territories. POST /v1/listings→201 · ES-24117 Outreachagent09:41 Pushed the Hindi scheme to 38 kiranas in the Nagpur cluster: buy 10 get 2 for 48 hours, no shop over 4× its own 14-day sales. fcm.send→38 kiranas · Hindi DonationagentDay 0 Mango Drink batch: booked Feeding India for 58 units. India FoodBanking Network needs 21+ days and 100+ units. foodbank.match→Feeding India · 58 units Outreachagent11:41 31 of 38 kiranas ordered all 588 units in about two hours, each under its cap. orders.sum→588 units · 31 shops Negotiatoragent11:03 Agrawal Wholesale bid ₹13 for all 772, below the reserve. Countered at ₹14.20 with 24-hour dispatch from Rakesh bhai's calendar. listing.counter→₹13.00 → ₹14.20 Agrawal jiperson11:09 Accepted ₹14.20 and paid the ₹1,644 token. Rakesh bhaipersonMon 5 Oct Loaded Agrawal Wholesale's truck for Raipur once the balance landed. PaperworkagentMon 5 Oct Drafted Rakesh's invoice INV/26-27/0931 for him to issue, checked the e-way bill rule, issued the price-support credit note CN/0117 and wrote the ITC memo. docs.invoice→₹11,510 · drafteway.check→below ₹50,000docs.credit_note→₹8,768itc.memo→₹1,224 retained Rakesh bhaipersonTue 6 Oct Ran the Tuesday round: 31 drops, 588 packets. OutreachagentFri 9 Oct Shelf check: the salesman counted the scheme packs at 31 shops. Jai Durga Stores, Kamptee, has 18 of 24 left: pick up 12 on Thursday's round and leave 6. shelf.check→31 shops counted ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Back to Route Room | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | ExpireSoon request | ExpireSoon response | Units ordered | Nagpur cluster: Kalamna godown and 38 kiranas, 31 ordered | POST /v1/listings → 201 · ES-24117 | fcm.send → 38 kiranas · Hindi | foodbank.match → Feeding India · 58 units | orders.sum → 588 units · 31 shops | listing.counter → ₹13.00 → ₹14.20 | docs.invoice → ₹11,510 · draft | eway.check → below ₹50,000 | docs.credit_note → ₹8,768 | itc.memo → ₹1,224 retained | shelf.check → 31 shops counted⟩",
  "inbox": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Inbox Inbox All caught up Feeding India confirmed58 packs of Mango Drink, pickup Tuesday 10:00 from Begum Bazaar. Served at the Charminar hunger spot.Day 1Awarded on ExpireSoon772 units at ₹14.20 to Agrawal Wholesale, Raipur. Token ₹1,644 received; balance ₹9,318 due in 48 h.11:09Plan ready · MF-2409-117Plan for MF-2409-117: 588 units kirana (₹18), 772 units ExpireSoon (₹15). Net ₹21,770, ₹26,340 better than write-off. GST ITC ₹1,224 safe. Tap to review and approve.09:23Masala Chips 150 g · NagpurPriya ji, Nagpur godown mein Masala Chips 150g (batch MF-2409-117) ki 1,360 units 18 Nov se pehle nahi bikengi. Q-commerce block hai. Route dekhne ke liye tap karein.09:00Rakesh Traders is set upRakesh bhai signed in and allowed listings, scheme offers, invoice drafts and dispatch slots in his name, inside your floors.Thu 16:52 ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings⟩",
  "paperwork": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Paperwork Paperwork MF-2409-117 · prepared by the Paperwork agent at the award Rakesh's invoice₹11,510₹11,510 Price support₹8,768₹8,768 GST credit kept₹1,224₹1,224 Things to chase0 Document pack Generated, drafted or not required, each with its reason Exportreviewed drafted Tax invoice INV/26-27/0931 · Rakesh Traders ₹11,510₹11,510not required E-way bill check MF-2409-117 · Rakesh Traders ₹11,510₹11,510generated Price-support credit note CN/0117 · Munchly Foods ₹8,768₹8,768generated GST ITC memo s.17(5)(h) · Munchly Foods ₹1,224₹1,224not required FSSAI surplus-food checklist no donation · Munchly Foods Nothing to filenot required Destruction certificate 0 units left · Munchly Foods Nothing to file Who keeps what Rakesh Traders receives₹30,314 and paid 1,360 × ₹22, the van and the fee−₹30,314 He ends whole₹0 Expiry claim Munchly avoids₹34,490 Price support it pays instead−₹8,768 Better for Munchly₹25,722₹25,722 The same ₹25,722 swing as the ledger, seen from Munchly's cash: the ₹22 credit Rakesh would have claimed and the ₹22 he paid cancel out. At plan prices it is ₹8,150 of support and a ₹26,340 swing. Credit note, GST memo, and Rakesh's invoice attached as evidence. First batch this year with nothing for me to chase. Anita · finance Tax invoice Drafted for Rakesh Traders Tax invoice INV/26-27/0931 · draft · 5 Oct 2026 IGST FromRakesh TradersKalamna Market, Nagpur, MaharashtraGSTIN 27AABCR1234F1Z5 ToAgrawal WholesaleGanj Mandi, Raipur, Chhattisgarh · place of supply 22GSTIN 22AAGFA4821M1Z3 ItemHSNQtyRateTaxableMunchly Masala Chips 150 gBatch MF-2409-117 · best before 18 Nov 20262005772₹14.20₹10,962.40 Taxable value₹10,962.40IGST 5% Maharashtra → Chhattisgarh₹548.00Round off−₹0.40Invoice total₹11,510.00 Drafted by the Paperwork agent for Rakesh Traders to issue from Tally. Chips moved from 12% to 5% GST under GST 2.0 on 22 September 2025. The MRP of ₹30.00 stays printed on every pack: a discounted sale is fine, a second MRP is not (Legal Metrology). ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings⟩",
