  "execution": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Route Room Execution Execution MF-2409-117 · day 0 to 14 · four agents Lister · ExpireSoonawarded POST /v1/listings { "seller": "Rakesh Traders, Nagpur", "on_behalf": "one-time permission · inside Munchly floors", "sku": "MF-MC-150", "batch": "MF-2409-117", "units": 772, "price": 15.00, "reserve": 13.50, "mrp": 30.00, "best_before": "2026-11-18", "hide_from_pincodes": ["440", "441", "442", "411", "412", "452", "453", "500", "501"], "label_photo": "gs://smart-clearance/labels/MF-2409-117.jpg" }HTTP/1.1 201 Created { "id": "ES-24117", "status": "awarded", "url": "https://expiresoon.example/l/ES-24117" } The marketplace is mocked; the request and response are what a partner API returns. Buyers in Munchly's territories never see the lot. Open on ExpireSoon Outreach · 38 kiranaspush · Hindi नमस्ते Shree Ganesh Kirana! Munchly Masala Chips 150g पर आज खास ऑफर: 10 पैकेट लो, 2 मुफ़्त. Best before 18 Nov 2026. सिर्फ़ 48 घंटे. ऑर्डर के लिए टैप करें — Rakesh Traders 313012345678910123456789 / 38kiranas ordered 588501234567898012345678980123456789 / 588units ItwariMahalSitabuldiSadarDharampethKampteeWardha RoadWardhaKalamna godown Schematic map · not to scale Sainath Kirana Wardha12 11:41Anand General Store Dharampeth24 11:38Vithal Stores Mahal12 11:34 Negotiatorawarded · ₹14.20 Can you do ₹13 for all 772? Agrawal Wholesale, Raipur · 11:02 ₹14.20 for 772, Nagpur stock, dispatch within 24 h of balance. Rakesh Traders · Negotiator agent · 11:03 Ok, ₹14.20. Token paid. Agrawal Wholesale, Raipur · 11:09 ExpireSoon, planned772 × ₹15.00₹11,580ExpireSoon, actual772 × ₹14.20₹10,962Net, planned₹21,770Net, actual−₹618 on the counter₹21,152 Token ₹1,644 received · balance ₹9,318 plus IGST in 48 h Donation · Mango Drinkpickup confirmed MF-2410-118 · 22 days leftLakshmi Agencies, Hyderabad: 1,372 packs to her kiranas, 150 to her staff sale, 58 left for a food bank. Too few days for ExpireSoon. Feeding India15+ days, 50+ units · volunteer pickup in 48 hmatchesIndia FoodBanking Networkneeds 21+ days and 100+ units58 units The GST credit on donated packs is reversed: section 17(5)(h) blocks it on gifts, and since 1 October 2023 section 17(5)(fa) blocks it on CSR donations too. Shelf check · day 7Friday 9 Oct Rakesh's salesman counted the scheme packs at 31 shops on his beat. 30 are selling in time; one is slow. Jai Durga Stores, Kamptee18 of 24 left It took 24 a week ago, so it is selling about one a day. Pick up on Thursday's round12 packs Leave the ones it can sell in time6 packs Returns go to the Nagpur staff sale or to Feeding India, and are accepted until 29 Oct. Agent timeline Notifieragent09:23 Sent Priya the plan to review, and Rakesh bhai the same plan with a pause button. Priyaperson09:40 Approved the plan from her phone. Listeragent09:41 Posted 772 units on ExpireSoon in Rakesh Traders' name at ₹15, with the label photo and dates. Reserve ₹13.50; hidden from buyers inside Munchly's territories. POST /v1/listings→201 · ES-24117 Outreachagent09:41 Pushed the Hindi scheme to 38 kiranas in the Nagpur cluster: buy 10 get 2 for 48 hours, no shop over 4× its own 14-day sales. fcm.send→38 kiranas · Hindi DonationagentDay 0 Mango Drink batch: booked Feeding India for 58 units. India FoodBanking Network needs 21+ days and 100+ units. foodbank.match→Feeding India · 58 units Outreachagent11:41 31 of 38 kiranas ordered all 588 units in about two hours, each under its cap. orders.sum→588 units · 31 shops Negotiatoragent11:03 Agrawal Wholesale bid ₹13 for all 772, below the reserve. Countered at ₹14.20 with 24-hour dispatch from Rakesh bhai's calendar. listing.counter→₹13.00 → ₹14.20 Agrawal jiperson11:09 Accepted ₹14.20 and paid the ₹1,644 token. Rakesh bhaipersonMon 5 Oct Loaded Agrawal Wholesale's truck for Raipur once the balance landed. PaperworkagentMon 5 Oct Drafted Rakesh's invoice INV/26-27/0931 for him to issue, checked the e-way bill rule, issued the price-support credit note CN/0117 and wrote the ITC memo. docs.invoice→₹11,510 · drafteway.check→below ₹50,000docs.credit_note→₹8,768itc.memo→₹1,224 retained Rakesh bhaipersonTue 6 Oct Ran the Tuesday round: 31 drops, 588 packets. OutreachagentFri 9 Oct Shelf check: the salesman counted the scheme packs at 31 shops. Jai Durga Stores, Kamptee, has 18 of 24 left: pick up 12 on Thursday's round and leave 6. shelf.check→31 shops counted Impactagent30 Oct The return window closed on 29 Oct. Posted the ledger: 217.6 kg diverted, 544 kg CO₂e avoided (indicative), 0 meals. BRSR row written. ledger.post→₹21,152brsr.rows→Principle 6 ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Back to Route Room | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | ExpireSoon request | ExpireSoon response | Units ordered | Nagpur cluster: Kalamna godown and 38 kiranas, 31 ordered | POST /v1/listings → 201 · ES-24117 | fcm.send → 38 kiranas · Hindi | foodbank.match → Feeding India · 58 units | orders.sum → 588 units · 31 shops | listing.counter → ₹13.00 → ₹14.20 | docs.invoice → ₹11,510 · draft | eway.check → below ₹50,000 | docs.credit_note → ₹8,768 | itc.memo → ₹1,224 retained | shelf.check → 31 shops counted | ledger.post → ₹21,152 | brsr.rows → Principle 6⟩",
  "inbox": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Inbox Inbox All caught up Batch closed · 0 cartons destroyed₹21,152 recovered, ₹1,224 GST credit kept, 217.6 kg kept out of landfill.30 OctFeeding India confirmed58 packs of Mango Drink, pickup Tuesday 10:00 from Begum Bazaar. Served at the Charminar hunger spot.Day 1Awarded on ExpireSoon772 units at ₹14.20 to Agrawal Wholesale, Raipur. Token ₹1,644 received; balance ₹9,318 due in 48 h.11:09Plan ready · MF-2409-117Plan for MF-2409-117: 588 units kirana (₹18), 772 units ExpireSoon (₹15). Net ₹21,770, ₹26,340 better than write-off. GST ITC ₹1,224 safe. Tap to review and approve.09:23Masala Chips 150 g · NagpurPriya ji, Nagpur godown mein Masala Chips 150g (batch MF-2409-117) ki 1,360 units 18 Nov se pehle nahi bikengi. Q-commerce block hai. Route dekhne ke liye tap karein.09:00Rakesh Traders is set upRakesh bhai signed in and allowed listings, scheme offers, invoice drafts and dispatch slots in his name, inside your floors.Thu 16:52 ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings⟩",
  "paperwork": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Paperwork Paperwork MF-2409-117 · prepared by the Paperwork agent at the award Rakesh's invoice₹11,510₹11,510 Price support₹8,768₹8,768 GST credit kept₹1,224₹1,224 Things to chase0 Document pack Generated, drafted or not required, each with its reason Exportreviewed drafted Tax invoice INV/26-27/0931 · Rakesh Traders ₹11,510₹11,510not required E-way bill check MF-2409-117 · Rakesh Traders ₹11,510₹11,510generated Price-support credit note CN/0117 · Munchly Foods ₹8,768₹8,768generated GST ITC memo s.17(5)(h) · Munchly Foods ₹1,224₹1,224not required FSSAI surplus-food checklist no donation · Munchly Foods Nothing to filenot required Destruction certificate 0 units left · Munchly Foods Nothing to file Who keeps what Rakesh Traders receives₹30,314 and paid 1,360 × ₹22, the van and the fee−₹30,314 He ends whole₹0 Expiry claim Munchly avoids₹34,490 Price support it pays instead−₹8,768 Better for Munchly₹25,722₹25,722 The same ₹25,722 swing as the ledger, seen from Munchly's cash: the ₹22 credit Rakesh would have claimed and the ₹22 he paid cancel out. At plan prices it is ₹8,150 of support and a ₹26,340 swing. Credit note, GST memo, and Rakesh's invoice attached as evidence. First batch this year with nothing for me to chase. Anita · finance Tax invoice Drafted for Rakesh Traders Tax invoice INV/26-27/0931 · draft · 5 Oct 2026 IGST FromRakesh TradersKalamna Market, Nagpur, MaharashtraGSTIN 27AABCR1234F1Z5 ToAgrawal WholesaleGanj Mandi, Raipur, Chhattisgarh · place of supply 22GSTIN 22AAGFA4821M1Z3 ItemHSNQtyRateTaxableMunchly Masala Chips 150 gBatch MF-2409-117 · best before 18 Nov 20262005772₹14.20₹10,962.40 Taxable value₹10,962.40IGST 5% Maharashtra → Chhattisgarh₹548.00Round off−₹0.40Invoice total₹11,510.00 Drafted by the Paperwork agent for Rakesh Traders to issue from Tally. Chips moved from 12% to 5% GST under GST 2.0 on 22 September 2025. The MRP of ₹30.00 stays printed on every pack: a discounted sale is fine, a second MRP is not (Legal Metrology). ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings⟩",
  "profile": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Profile Profile Supply-chain operator Priya Deshmukh Supply-chain operator · Munchly FoodsGoogle Workspace · priya.deshmukh@munchly.in Workspace Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.comMunchly staff Your work Setup and guardrailsDMS mapping, floors, territory guard, permissionsFinance & ESGLedger, BRSR export Appearance ThemeLightDarkAuto Notifications LanguageEnglishहिन्दीPush notificationsWeekly digest by email Offers to the trade go out in the language each person picks. Account Switch personTry the journey as someone else in the story Reset demo dataPuts the batch back to the start Sign outBack to munchly.smartclearance.com ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Theme | Notification language | Push notifications | Weekly digest⟩",
  "report": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Finance & ESG QuarterThis batch Finance & ESG Q3 FY27 · Oct to Dec 2026 · one ledger, two readings MF-2409-117 posted · ₹21,152 recovered · 217.6 kg out of landfill · BRSR row addedledger Recovered₹6.3 lakh₹60123456789.30123456789lakh GST credit protected₹79,000₹7012345678990123456789,001234567890012345678900123456789 Kept out of landfill5.750123456789.70123456789 t CO₂e avoided14.251012345678940123456789.2012345678950123456789 tindicative · 2.5 kg a kg Meals served3,70030123456789,701234567890012345678900123456789 A synthetic quarter: the totals are the walkthrough's; the weekly split, the channel mix and the BRSR split below are illustrative. Week 1 is this batch. Recovered against the would-be write-off Illustrative weekly split of the quarter RecoveredWould-be write-off 0₹35k₹70kW1W3W5W7W9W11W13 Channel mix Share of units by where they went · illustrative Kirana scheme: 42%ExpireSoon: 38%Staff sale: 5%Food bank: 12%Write-off: 3% Kirana scheme 42%ExpireSoon 38%Staff sale 5%Food bank 12%Write-off 3% How the tax maths works Destroying stock costs more than the stock. You lose it at cost, reverse the GST input credit under Section 17(5)(h), pay to dispose of it, and owe EPR on the product and pack. Selling it under a tax invoice keeps the credit. That is why every routed batch protects its ITC, even at half the MRP. Donations reverse it. Section 17(5)(h) blocks credit on gifts, and since 1 October 2023 section 17(5)(fa) blocks it on CSR donations too, so a food-bank route costs the credit on every pack. Disposal ₹1.50 a unit, indicativeEPR ₹6 a kg, indicativeCO₂e 2.5 kg per kg, indicative 5.7 tonnes kept out of landfill this quarter, with invoices behind every kilo. That goes straight into the annual report. Vikram · sustainability BRSR Core Principle 6, waste management · the quarter's 5.7 t, split illustrative Export BRSR table CategoryDiverted, kgResoldDonatedDisposedEvidenceFood waste: packaged food past quick-commerce gates4,8404,26058060Tax invoices, ExpireSoon listing IDs, in-app order logs, food-bank receiptsPlastic packaging (EPR)8607709010Packaging weights per SKU, EPR factor, the same invoices ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Period | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Weekly recovered against would-be write-off | Channel mix | BRSR waste table⟩",
  "route": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Command Center Route Room Route Room MF-2409-117 · Munchly Masala Chips 150 g · Rakesh Traders, Nagpur 47days leftbest before 18 Nov 2026 Blinkit47/90Zepto47/110Instamart47/1101,360 of 1,840 units at risk · sells 12 a day ConnectonceDetect09:00Verify09:20Value09:21Decide09:22Approve09:40Executeday 0⁠–⁠14Settleday 3⁠–⁠7Reportafter 29 Oct Label, read from the shelf Vision · 09:20 matches the DMS record MUNCHLYMasala Chips 150 gBATCH MF-2409-117MFG 18 MAY 2026BEST BEFORE 18 NOV 2026MRP ₹30.00 incl. of all taxes24 × 150 g Verified · Gemini vision · 0.97 BatchMF-2409-117Manufactured18 May 2026Best before18 Nov 2026Shelf life184 days · 74% usedMRP₹30.00 · 24 × 150 gRecordsmatch Five channels, priced Valuer · 09:21 · per unit, after costs ChartTable Kirana cluster₹17.50ExpireSoon₹15.00Staff sale₹12.00Food bank−₹1.40Write-off−₹19.36 Hover a bar for price, capacity, time to clear and what happens to the GST credit. Destroying costs −₹19.36 a unit; a donation costs ₹1.40, because the credit on a gift is reversed. Recommended split Router · 09:22 588 · Kirana cluster772 · ExpireSoon 01,360 units at risk 588 units to the kirana cluster at ₹18 effective (₹21.60 a pack, 2 free with every 10). The best price, and it keeps stock inside Munchly's own trade. Capped by what 38 kiranas can move in 14 days with the scheme, on top of the 12 a day they already sell. 772 units to ExpireSoon at ₹15 (reserve ₹13.50), listed in Rakesh Traders' name and hidden from buyers inside Munchly's territories: unlimited depth, 5 to 9 days, the buyer pays freight. The Nagpur staff sale is eligible but pays less a unit than ExpireSoon, so it gets nothing this time. Alternative considered: all 1,360 to ExpireSoon Net ₹20,300: ₹1,470 less, and nothing stays in Munchly's own trade. not chosen If destroyedwrite-off Stock at cost 1,360 × ₹16−₹21,760 GST credit reversed s.17(5)(h) · ₹0.90 a unit−₹1,224 Disposal and transport ₹1.50 a unit, indicative−₹2,040 EPR and waste liability 217.6 kg × ₹6, indicative−₹1,306 Effect on the P&Lminus ₹26,330−₹26,330 If routedrecommended 588 → Kirana cluster at ₹18 effective, 490 charged at ₹21.60₹10,584772 → ExpireSoon at ₹15₹11,580 Van delivery and listing fee −₹394 Net recovered 53% of MRP₹21,770₹21,770 Book cost of the stock sold 1,360 × ₹16−₹21,760 Effect on the P&L+₹10 ₹26,340₹26,340better than destroying it: +₹10 instead of −₹26,330. In cash, the ₹21,770 recovered plus ₹4,570 of credit reversal, disposal and EPR never spent. Approved by Priya · 09:40 · phone Logged with who, when and device. The agents are executing; Rakesh bhai has the same plan in his app. Watch execution Agent timeline Gaps drawn to the clock Watcheragent09:00 Checked 312 batches across 4 distributors. MF-2409-117 fails all three quick-commerce gates and will not sell through. gates.check→Blinkit 47/90 · Zepto 47/110 · Instamart 47/110sellthrough.project→12/day × 40 days = 480 of 1,840pubsub.publish→batch.at_risk Visionagent09:05 Asked Rakesh Traders for one label photo before quoting any price. fcm.send→Rakesh bhai · Hindi Rakesh bhaiperson09:19 Sent one photo of the carton label from shelf B4. Visionagent09:20 Read the label: batch MF-2409-117, MFG 18 May 2026, best before 18 Nov 2026, MRP ₹30.00, confidence 0.97. Matches the DMS record. gemini.vision.read_label→confidence 0.97dms.reconcile→match Valueragent09:21 Priced five channels against 47 days left. Destroying costs −₹19.36 a unit, −₹26,330 for the batch. bigquery.price_history→snacks · 47 daysgst.rate→HSN 2005 → 5%cost_sheet.input_gst→₹0.90 a packepr.factor→₹6 / kg Routeragent09:22 588 units to the kirana cluster at ₹18 effective, capped by what 38 kiranas can move in 14 days; 772 to ExpireSoon at ₹15. The Nagpur staff sale pays less a unit, so it gets nothing this time. allocate.greedy→1,360 units → net ₹21,770 Notifieragent09:23 Sent Priya the plan to review, and Rakesh bhai the same plan with a pause button. Priyaperson09:40 Approved the plan from her phone. Listeragent09:41 Posted 772 units on ExpireSoon in Rakesh Traders' name at ₹15, with the label photo and dates. Reserve ₹13.50; hidden from buyers inside Munchly's territories. POST /v1/listings→201 · ES-24117 Outreachagent09:41 Pushed the Hindi scheme to 38 kiranas in the Nagpur cluster: buy 10 get 2 for 48 hours, no shop over 4× its own 14-day sales. fcm.send→38 kiranas · Hindi DonationagentDay 0 Mango Drink batch: booked Feeding India for 58 units. India FoodBanking Network needs 21+ days and 100+ units. foodbank.match→Feeding India · 58 units Outreachagent11:41 31 of 38 kiranas ordered all 588 units in about two hours, each under its cap. orders.sum→588 units · 31 shops Negotiatoragent11:03 Agrawal Wholesale bid ₹13 for all 772, below the reserve. Countered at ₹14.20 with 24-hour dispatch from Rakesh bhai's calendar. listing.counter→₹13.00 → ₹14.20 Agrawal jiperson11:09 Accepted ₹14.20 and paid the ₹1,644 token. Rakesh bhaipersonMon 5 Oct Loaded Agrawal Wholesale's truck for Raipur once the balance landed. PaperworkagentMon 5 Oct Drafted Rakesh's invoice INV/26-27/0931 for him to issue, checked the e-way bill rule, issued the price-support credit note CN/0117 and wrote the ITC memo. docs.invoice→₹11,510 · drafteway.check→below ₹50,000docs.credit_note→₹8,768itc.memo→₹1,224 retained Rakesh bhaipersonTue 6 Oct Ran the Tuesday round: 31 drops, 588 packets. OutreachagentFri 9 Oct Shelf check: the salesman counted the scheme packs at 31 shops. Jai Durga Stores, Kamptee, has 18 of 24 left: pick up 12 on Thursday's round and leave 6. shelf.check→31 shops counted Impactagent30 Oct The return window closed on 29 Oct. Posted the ledger: 217.6 kg diverted, 544 kg CO₂e avoided (indicative), 0 meals. BRSR row written. ledger.post→₹21,152brsr.rows→Principle 6 ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Back to Command Center | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 47 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 184-day life (110 days), has 47 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 184-day life (110 days), has 47 | Stages | Carton label on shelf B4: batch MF-2409-117, MFG 18 May 2026, best before 18 Nov 2026, MRP ₹30.00 | View | Net rupees per unit by channel | gates.check → Blinkit 47/90 · Zepto 47/110 · Instamart 47/110 | sellthrough.project → 12/day × 40 days = 480 of 1,840 | pubsub.publish → batch.at_risk | fcm.send → Rakesh bhai · Hindi | gemini.vision.read_label → confidence 0.97 | dms.reconcile → match | bigquery.price_history → snacks · 47 days | gst.rate → HSN 2005 → 5% | cost_sheet.input_gst → ₹0.90 a pack | epr.factor → ₹6 / kg | allocate.greedy → 1,360 units → net ₹21,770 | POST /v1/listings → 201 · ES-24117 | fcm.send → 38 kiranas · Hindi | foodbank.match → Feeding India · 58 units | orders.sum → 588 units · 31 shops | listing.counter → ₹13.00 → ₹14.20 | docs.invoice → ₹11,510 · draft | eway.check → below ₹50,000 | docs.credit_note → ₹8,768 | itc.memo → ₹1,224 retained | shelf.check → 31 shops counted | ledger.post → ₹21,152 | brsr.rows → Principle 6⟩",
  "setup": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Route Room Execution Batches SetupReports Finance & ESG Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Setup Setup Connect the stock data once and set the rules the agents must obey dms_export_2026-10-01.csvBizom-style DMS export · 312 batches · 4 distributorsLoaded into BigQuery Smart-Clearance fieldColumn in your fileStatusdistributordistributor_namemappedskuitem_codemappedbatchbatch_nomappedmfgmfg_datemappedbest beforebb_datemappedunitsclosing_qtymappedgodownlocationmappedpincodepinmapped Data Agent mapped 8 of 8 columns and back-filled 90 days of sell-through by pincode and by shop. Floor price by category Snacks₹10.50 on a ₹30 pack35%Biscuits₹14.00 on a ₹40 pack35%Staples₹22.00 on a ₹55 pack40%Beverages₹6.00 on a ₹20 pack30%Personal care₹48.00 on a ₹120 pack40% No channel may sell below its category's floor. Territory guard Nagpur with Wardha and KampteeRakesh Traders · pincodes 440, 441, 442…PunePatil Distributors · pincodes 411, 412…IndoreGupta & Sons · pincodes 452, 453…HyderabadLakshmi Agencies · pincodes 500, 501… Hide listings inside the territories ExpireSoon listings are hidden from buyers inside these territories, matched by pincode, so clearance stock never undercuts a Munchly distributor. Approval policy Routes per channel that need a tap10 Personal care never goes to food banks Premium gift packs never go to a staff sale After that the agents run inside the guardrails and report. Channel allow-list CategoryExpireSoonKiranasStaff saleFood banksnacksAllowedAllowedAllowedAllowedbiscuitsAllowedAllowedAllowedAllowedstaplesAllowedAllowedAllowedAllowedbeveragesAllowedAllowedAllowedAllowedpersonal careAllowedAllowedAllowedNever Discount D2C applies only to Munchly's own warehouse stock. A distributor's stock is his, so it never goes to Munchly's own site. Distributors' one-time permission Rakesh TradersNagpurgranted · Thu 16:52Patil DistributorsPunegranted · 1 OctGupta & SonsIndoregranted · 1 OctLakshmi AgenciesHyderabadgranted · 1 Oct Each distributor lets the agent list his Munchly stock, offer schemes to his kiranas, draft his invoices and book dispatch slots, inside Munchly's floors. He can pause it at any time. Scheme returns and planning Kiranas may return scheme packs until29 Oct for this batch20 days before Scheme uplift on normal sales3.5× Van rate, a unit₹0.50 The uplift and the van rate are planning assumptions. The return window lets returned packs reach the godown in time for a staff sale or a food bank. Feeding Indiapartner 15+ days left · at least 50 units · Volunteer pickup within 48 h, hunger spots in 100+ citiesIn-app receiptIndia FoodBanking Networkpartner 21+ days left · at least 100 units · Drop at a member warehouse or a scheduled pickupDonation acknowledgement (CSR / 80G, indicative) The true cost of a write-offshown before any batch is routed Stock at cost₹16.00+ GST credit reversed₹0.90+ Disposal₹1.50+ EPR, indicative₹0.96 = Destroying, a unitminus ₹19.36−₹19.36 For Masala Chips 150 g: cost ₹16; ₹0.90 of input GST a packet from the cost sheet (chips are at 5% GST since GST 2.0); disposal ₹1.50 a unit; EPR ₹6 a kilo of product and pack. Factors marked indicative are editable here. Watching since setupOpen Command Center ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Field mapping | Floor for Snacks | Fewer Floor for Snacks | More Floor for Snacks | Floor for Biscuits | Fewer Floor for Biscuits | More Floor for Biscuits | Floor for Staples | Fewer Floor for Staples | More Floor for Staples | Floor for Beverages | Fewer Floor for Beverages | More Floor for Beverages | Floor for Personal care | Fewer Floor for Personal care | More Floor for Personal care | Territory guard | routes | Fewer routes | More routes | Personal care never to food banks | Gift packs never to staff sale | Channel rules by category | days before best-before | Fewer days before best-before | More days before best-before | Scheme uplift | Fewer Scheme uplift | More Scheme uplift | Van rate | Fewer Van rate | More Van rate⟩",
}
`;

