{
  "audit": "Audit log Audit log Every human decision, with who and when EveryoneVikramRakesh bhaiAnitaMeeraAgrawal jiGanesh jiPriya Vikram signed off the BRSR rowMF-2409-11730 OctRakesh bhai ran the Tuesday round: 31 dropsNagpur clusterTue 6 OctAnita reviewed Munchly's credit note and GST memoMF-2409-117Mon 5 OctRakesh bhai loaded Agrawal Wholesale's truckES-24117 · RaipurMon 5 OctMeera confirmed the pickup, Tuesday 10:00MF-2410-118 · 58 packsDay 1Agrawal ji bid ₹13.00ES-2411711:02Ganesh ji ordered 24 packetsMasala Chips scheme09:52Priya approved the planMF-2409-117 · net ₹21,77009:40Rakesh bhai sent the label photoMF-2409-11709:19Rakesh bhai gave the one-time permission to act in his nameRakesh Traders · inside Munchly's floorsThu 16:52Priya confirmed DMS mapping and guardrailsSetupThu 16:41 WorkspaceUsersGuardrailsAudit ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Main⟩",
