{
  "batches": "Batches Batches Every lot the Watcher sees, from the DMS export Masala Chips 150 gCleared Rakesh Traders · Nagpur 47 days left Mango Drink 200 mlIn motion Lakshmi Agencies · Hyderabad 22 days left Masala Chips 150 gGated · selling through Gupta & Sons · Indore 74 days left Peanut Chikki 100 gGated · selling through Gupta & Sons · Indore 61 days left Masala Oats 200 gGated · selling through Patil Distributors · Pune 75 days left Choco Cream Biscuits 200 gGated · selling through Patil Distributors · Pune 96 days left Instant Poha 250 gSafe Lakshmi Agencies · Hyderabad 200 days left Aloe Face Wash 100 mlSafe Rakesh Traders · Nagpur 460 days left Coconut Hair Oil 200 mlSafe Gupta & Sons · Indore 500 days left TodayRouteLiveBatches ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | 47 of 180 days of shelf life left | 22 of 180 days of shelf life left | 74 of 180 days of shelf life left | 61 of 180 days of shelf life left | 75 of 270 days of shelf life left | 96 of 270 days of shelf life left | 200 of 270 days of shelf life left | 460 of 730 days of shelf life left | 500 of 730 days of shelf life left | Main⟩",
